 Optional Advanced Topics
Deep learning on raw signals (CNNs on time windows)
Autoencoders for anomaly detection
Edge deployment with TensorFlow Lite or PyTorch Mobile
Online learning (models that update live)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

combining multiple sensor types opens the door to serious applications in robotics, motion analysis, gesture recognition, and autonomous systems.

🔧 1. Hardware Setup
Start small and modular:

✅ 3-axis Accelerometers (e.g., MPU6050, ADXL345)
✅ 3-axis Gyroscopes (often combined with accelerometers)
🔄 Optional: magnetometer (for orientation), ultrasonic (distance), barometer, GPS

Goal: Get real-time data streaming from sensors (use Raspberry Pi, Arduino, ESP32, etc.)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

2. Sensor Data Pipeline
Build a robust pipeline to:
Read sensor data (via I2C/SPI/Serial)
Timestamp it
Store it (CSV, SQLite, cloud)
Optionally visualize live (matplotlib, Plotly, or web dashboard)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

3. Data Preprocessing
Synchronize sensor streams (if separate)
Normalize / standardize data
Filter noise (low-pass, moving average, Kalman filter)
Align sampling rates

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

4. Feature Engineering
From raw sensors, compute:
Acceleration magnitude: √(x² + y² + z²)
Angular velocity trends
Orientation: combine gyro + accel with complementary/Kalman filters
FFT for frequency features (vibration, oscillation)
Movement patterns (e.g., gesture windows, rolling windows of time series)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROJECTS IDEAS


| Goal                             | Description                                                        |
| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Human activity recognition**   | Detect walking, running, gestures (great starter project)          |
| **Gesture-controlled robot arm** | Use motion data to control servos                                  |
| **Motion pattern recognition**   | Learn motion signatures (fall detection, dancing, etc.)            |
| **Balance bot**                  | Use sensors to stabilize a two-wheeled robot                       |
| **IMU-based SLAM (advanced)**    | Combine data with mapping/navigation                               |
| **Sensor fusion AI**             | Combine multiple sensors to predict user behavior or object motion |
| **TinyML on-device inference**   | Deploy trained models directly to microcontrollers                 |

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
MODEL TRAINING

| Data Type            | Model Suggestions                      |
| -------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| Small, labeled sets  | RandomForest, SVM, Logistic Regression |
| Time-sequence window | RNN, LSTM, GRU                         |
| Raw sensor data      | 1D CNN or LSTM                         |
| Real-time behavior   | Sliding window + incremental learning  |
